OL,3,GNEWSAHow Aardman's 1976 move inspired
OL,4,Acharity link-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FAardman Animations' move to Bristol 50
OL,7,Fyears ago inspired its founders to want
OL,8,Fto help the city, a desire that
OL,9,Feventually led to a charity partnership
OL,10,Fthat has raised many millions of
OL,11,Fpounds.
OL,13,FSince 1995, the company behind Wallace
OL,14,Fand Gromit, Morph, and Shaun the Sheep
OL,15,Fhas partnered with The Grand Appeal,
OL,16,FBristol Children's Hospital charity.
OL,18,FIt allowed fundraisers to use its
OL,19,FWallace and Gromit characters to try to
OL,20,Fraise #10m towards a new building. The
OL,21,Fappeal has since raised #90m.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
