OL,3,GNEWSAHow Aardman's 1976 move inspired
OL,4,Acharity link-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FNicola Masters, the charity's director,
OL,7,Fsaid: "They gave us their creativity,
OL,8,Fand that's what we've been able to work
OL,9,Fwith to raise so much money for the
OL,10,Fchildren's hospital in Bristol over the
OL,11,Flast three decades."
